      {
        "id": 131594,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-17T04:13:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Reckless wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>And The Dreamer is too young to have a fully developed sexuality.\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>Not fully developed, but many six-year-olds are aware of their preferences and are clearly identifying with a particular gender by that age.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I was referring more to sexual preference, but that is a fair observation.</p>",
